  whatever [3mtheir[0m workflow is, and I'd want to hear about that before designing anything.

  I'll ask that one, and I'd rather have a vague honest answer than a confident invented one — "I don't know, I just
  wanted to build something" is a completely valid response and changes my recommendation (it would point at the
  cheapest version that teaches you the most).
